                            attributionSource.getToken(), attributionSource.getNext()),
                            skipProxyOperation);
                } finally {
                    Binder.restoreCallingIdentity(identity);
                }
            }
            superImpl.apply(clientId, code, attributionSource, skipProxyOperation);
        }

